---
layout: layout.njk
title: Free Production Finance Health Check
seo_title: "Free Production Finance Health Check | Tubes"
description: "A free 45 minute review of how your production company handles budgets, actuals, forecasting, approvals and reporting. Practical findings, no sales pitch."
permalink: /production-finance-health-check/
---
{#- Conversiepagina: lead magnet "Production Finance Health Check".
    Bewust géén CMS-secties maar één eigen template: de tweestapsvorm en het
    assessment-beeld zijn te specifiek om in het sectiesysteem te passen.
    Alle opmaak komt uit style.css (blok "Health Check"), de logica uit
    site.js. Formulieren posten naar /api/health-check in server.js.

    Let op: dit is geen softwarepagina. Tubes wordt pas ná de uitleg over de
    Health Check genoemd; hou dat zo bij tekstwijzigingen. -#}

{%- set improveOptions = [
  "Budgeting",
  "Budget vs actuals",
  "Forecasting",
  "Approvals",
  "Reporting",
  "Managing multiple productions",
  "All of the above",
  "Other"
] -%}
{%- set systemOptions = [
  "Excel or spreadsheets",
  "Existing production software",
  "Accounting software",
  "Combination of systems",
  "Other"
] -%}

{%- macro healthCheckForm(id, submitLabel) -%}
<form class="hc-form" id="{{ id }}" data-hc-form action="/api/health-check" data-endpoint="/api/health-check" novalidate>
  <input type="text" name="company_website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true" style="display:none" data-1p-ignore data-lpignore="true" data-form-type="other">

  <div class="hc-step hc-step-1" data-hc-step="1">
    <label class="hc-field" for="{{ id }}-email">Business email address
      <input type="email" id="{{ id }}-email" name="email" inputmode="email" autocomplete="email" spellcheck="false" required>
    </label>
    <p class="hc-help" id="{{ id }}-email-help">Where should we send your Health Check details?</p>
    <button type="submit" class="button button-primary hc-submit">Start My Free Health Check</button>
  </div>

  <div class="hc-step hc-step-2" data-hc-step="2" hidden>
    <p class="hc-step-note"><span class="hc-step-count">Step 2 of 2</span> A few details so we can prepare, then we will arrange a time.</p>

    <div class="hc-field-row">
      <label class="hc-field" for="{{ id }}-name">Name
        <input type="text" id="{{ id }}-name" name="name" autocomplete="name" required>
      </label>
      <label class="hc-field" for="{{ id }}-company">Company
        <input type="text" id="{{ id }}-company" name="company" autocomplete="organization" required>
      </label>
    </div>

    <label class="hc-field" for="{{ id }}-role">Role <span class="hc-optional">(optional)</span>
      <input type="text" id="{{ id }}-role" name="role" autocomplete="organization-title" placeholder="Line Producer, Head of Production, Financial Controller">
    </label>

    <fieldset class="hc-choice">
      <legend>What would you most like to improve? <span class="hc-optional">(optional)</span></legend>
      <div class="hc-choice-row">
        {%- for option in improveOptions %}
        <label class="hc-pill">
          <input type="radio" name="improve" value="{{ option }}">
          <span>{{ option }}</span>
        </label>
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>
    </fieldset>

    <fieldset class="hc-choice">
      <legend>How do you currently manage production finance? <span class="hc-optional">(optional)</span></legend>
      <div class="hc-choice-row">
        {%- for option in systemOptions %}
        <label class="hc-pill">
          <input type="radio" name="current_system" value="{{ option }}">
          <span>{{ option }}</span>
        </label>
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>
    </fieldset>

    <button type="submit" class="button button-primary hc-submit">{{ submitLabel }}</button>
  </div>

  <p class="form-status hc-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>

  <div class="hc-done" data-hc-done hidden>
    <p class="hc-done-title">Thanks. Your Health Check request has been received.</p>
    <p>We will be in touch shortly to arrange the session, and we will send two or three possible times.</p>

    {#- De vragenlijst staat op een eigen pagina, zodat de link ook los
        verstuurd kan worden. De aanvraag is hier al opgeslagen, dus wie
        hem overslaat is geen verloren lead. -#}
    <div class="hc-done-next">
      <p class="hc-done-next-title">One more minute, if you have it</p>
      <p>Tell us how the six areas stand today and we can prepare properly before we speak.</p>
      <a class="button button-primary" href="/production-finance-health-check/assessment/" data-hc-assess-link>Start the assessment</a>
    </div>

    <p class="hc-done-note">In the meantime, our <a href="/insights/">production finance articles</a> cover a few of the questions that come up most often.</p>
  </div>

  <p class="hc-privacy">Your details go to Tubes and stay with us. We use them to arrange your Health Check, to prepare for the session and to follow up on what we find, and we keep them in our own system. We do not sell them and we do not share them for anyone else's marketing. Ask us to delete them at any time. See how we handle data in <a href="/compliance/">security and compliance</a>.</p>
</form>
{%- endmacro -%}

<section class="section section-hero hc-hero theme-light">
  <div class="container hc-hero-grid">
    <div class="hc-hero-text">
      <span class="kicker">For film, television and production companies</span>
      <h1>How healthy is your production finance process?</h1>
      <p class="hc-lead">Get a free 45 minute session with a production finance specialist. We will look at how you currently manage budgets, actuals, forecasting, approvals and reporting, and identify opportunities to save time, improve visibility and reduce financial risk.</p>

      <div class="hc-form-card">
        {{ healthCheckForm("hc-form-top", "Request My Health Check") }}
      </div>

      <p class="hc-reassure"><strong>No obligation. No generic sales pitch. Just 45 minutes focused on your production.</strong></p>
    </div>

    <div class="hc-hero-visual">
      {#- Geen nagebootste Tubes-schermafbeelding: dit is het assessment zelf.
          De zes gebieden staan leeg, want er is nog niets beoordeeld. -#}
      <div class="hc-scan" aria-labelledby="hc-scan-title">
        <div class="hc-scan-head">
          <div>
            <span class="hc-scan-kicker">Assessment</span>
            <h2 class="hc-scan-title" id="hc-scan-title">Production Finance Health Check</h2>
          </div>
          <span class="chip chip-blue">45 minutes</span>
        </div>

        <ol class="hc-scan-list">
          <li><span class="hc-scan-num">01</span><span class="hc-scan-label">Budget structure and version control</span><span class="hc-scan-meter" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></li>
          <li><span class="hc-scan-num">02</span><span class="hc-scan-label">Budget to production handover</span><span class="hc-scan-meter" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></li>
          <li><span class="hc-scan-num">03</span><span class="hc-scan-label">Actuals and reconciliation</span><span class="hc-scan-meter" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></li>
          <li><span class="hc-scan-num">04</span><span class="hc-scan-label">Forecasting</span><span class="hc-scan-meter" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></li>
          <li><span class="hc-scan-num">05</span><span class="hc-scan-label">Approvals and controls</span><span class="hc-scan-meter" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></li>
          <li><span class="hc-scan-num">06</span><span class="hc-scan-label">Reporting and visibility</span><span class="hc-scan-meter" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></li>
        </ol>

        <div class="hc-scan-foot">
          <p class="hc-scan-key">Each area gets one of three labels</p>
          <ul class="hc-scan-chips">
            <li class="chip chip-mint">Strong</li>
            <li class="chip chip-amber">Could improve</li>
            <li class="chip chip-lavender">Opportunity</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="hc-scan-note">No score out of ten. We talk through each area with you and write down what we find.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section theme-white">
  <div class="container hc-narrow">
    <h2>We look at how production finance actually works in your organisation</h2>
    <p class="hc-lead">Every production company works differently. We start by understanding how budgets, costs, forecasts, approvals and reporting currently move through your organisation.</p>
    <ul class="hc-topics">
      <li>Budgeting</li>
      <li>Actual spend</li>
      <li>Budget versus actuals</li>
      <li>Forecasting</li>
      <li>Approvals</li>
      <li>Reporting</li>
      <li>Multiple productions</li>
      <li>Financial visibility</li>
      <li>Manual work and reconciliation</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="hc-aside-note">One question we always ask: how do you know today where a running production will end up financially? The answer usually says more about a process than any list of tools.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section theme-light">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-heading">You leave with a clearer picture of what can be improved</h2>
    <p class="section-intro hc-lead">During the session we note what we see. Afterwards you get a short written summary: the three main opportunities, where unnecessary manual work or financial risk sits, and which improvement is likely to have the most effect first.</p>
    <div class="cards-grid cards-3">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Reduce manual work</h3>
        <p>Identify processes involving unnecessary spreadsheets, duplication or reconciliation.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Improve financial visibility</h3>
        <p>See where budget, actual and forecast information could be easier to access and understand.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Improve control</h3>
        <p>Identify opportunities to improve approvals, budget versions and financial processes.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section theme-white">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-heading">How it works</h2>
    <ol class="hc-steps">
      <li>
        <span class="hc-steps-num">1</span>
        <h3>Tell us a little about your process</h3>
        <p>Complete the short form so we understand what you want to improve.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="hc-steps-num">2</span>
        <h3>45 minute Health Check</h3>
        <p>We talk through how production finance currently works within your organisation and identify areas of friction, manual work or risk.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="hc-steps-num">3</span>
        <h3>Receive your findings</h3>
        <p>We summarise the main opportunities and practical improvements we identified. If Tubes could help with any of these areas, we can show you how. There is no obligation to continue.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section theme-teal">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-heading">Areas we assess</h2>
    <p class="section-intro hc-lead">Six areas, worked through in order. The point is not to grade you, but to see where financial control is currently held together by hand.</p>
    <div class="hc-areas">
      <article class="hc-area">
        <span class="hc-area-num">01</span>
        <h3>Budget structure and version control</h3>
        <p>How budgets are built, how changes are made, and how you know which version is the current one.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="hc-area">
        <span class="hc-area-num">02</span>
        <h3>Budget to production handover</h3>
        <p>What happens after a budget is approved, and how the people spending the money get a working budget they can use.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="hc-area">
        <span class="hc-area-num">03</span>
        <h3>Actuals and reconciliation</h3>
        <p>How real costs come in, how they are coded, and how much manual work it takes to match them back to the budget.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="hc-area">
        <span class="hc-area-num">04</span>
        <h3>Forecasting</h3>
        <p>How commitments, costs to date and remaining costs add up to an expected final cost, and how often that picture is refreshed.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="hc-area">
        <span class="hc-area-num">05</span>
        <h3>Approvals and controls</h3>
        <p>Who may commit spend, who may change a budget, and how that is recorded.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="hc-area">
        <span class="hc-area-num">06</span>
        <h3>Reporting and visibility</h3>
        <p>Who gets reliable financial information, in what form, and how long it takes to produce.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
    <p class="hc-areas-legend">We label each area <span class="chip chip-mint">Strong</span> <span class="chip chip-amber">Could improve</span> <span class="chip chip-lavender">Opportunity</span> based on what you tell us. We never publish company names or findings.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section theme-white">
  <div class="container hc-narrow">
    <h2>And if we see somewhere Tubes could help, we will show you</h2>
    <p>Tubes is production finance software designed to bring budgets, actuals, forecasting, approvals and reporting together.</p>
    <p>During the Health Check we do not give a standard software demonstration. We first understand your process. If Tubes can solve one of the problems we identify, we can show you the relevant part of the platform.</p>
    <p class="hc-tubes-link"><a href="/platform/">Read about the platform</a> if you would rather look first.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-cta hc-final" id="hc-final">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-inner hc-final-inner">
      <div class="hc-final-text">
        <h2>How healthy is your production finance process?</h2>
        <p class="hc-lead">Spend 45 minutes with us and get a fresh look at where your current process works well and where there may be opportunities to improve it.</p>
        <p class="hc-reassure"><strong>Free. No obligation. No generic sales pitch.</strong></p>
      </div>
      <div class="hc-form-card">
        {{ healthCheckForm("hc-form-end", "Request My Health Check") }}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="hc-sticky" id="hc-sticky" hidden>
  <div class="hc-sticky-inner">
    <p>Free 45 minute Health Check</p>
    <a class="button button-primary" href="#hc-form-end" data-hc-sticky-cta>Start My Free Health Check</a>
  </div>
</div>
